# Fidelity Gate fixtures: 30-day sub-minute raw-bar parquets are large
# (~5 MB each). Only the durable subset (live real-money set: 308 ungated,
# 309 + 313 gated multi-TF) is committed as the standing nightly drift
# baseline. The full broad-coverage set is regenerated locally via
#   python -m fidelity.capture <sid> 30
# (see README.md for the fixture-set list). This keeps git light while
# preserving a durable baseline + the before/after [FC] protocol.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!sid_308_bars.parquet
!sid_308_gatecols.parquet
!sid_308_trades.parquet
!sid_308_manifest.json
!sid_309_bars.parquet
!sid_309_gatecols.parquet
!sid_309_trades.parquet
!sid_309_manifest.json
!sid_313_bars.parquet
!sid_313_gatecols.parquet
!sid_313_trades.parquet
!sid_313_manifest.json
